From bf51df665b458fda7c3eaf436c4d88dc119d7ec6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilmir Usmanov <ilmir.usmanov@jetbrains.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 17:51:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] KAPT: Deserialize only a handful of classes from KAPT
 incremental cache

Otherwise, the classes there can be poisoned and thus lead to
vulnerabilities.
 #KT-86604 Fixed
